	"TF.TTLobby.Elevator": "The elevator to the penthouse seems to be out of order.",
	"TF.TFWest.Closed": "The road to the western side of town is currently closed. It will hopefully open soon",
	"TF.Town.Gorilla": "This house is currently empty. You heard a Gorilla might be moving in? That can't be right...",
	"String.Cemetery.Half": "The top half this grave is missing. Hopefully, the resident is still in the bottom half.",
	"String.Antequary1": "A picture of a woman. It seems to be fading due to age.",
	"String.Antequary2": "A stack of crumbling maps. Most places on them don't seem to exist anymore.",
	"String.Antequary3": "An antique globe. The continents seem to be just a little bit... wrong.",
	"String.Antequary4": "An ornate magnifying glass with a heavy brass handle.",
	"String.Antequary5": "A strange key that looks both ancient and modern at the same time. It looks strangely familiar.",
	"String.Antequary6": "A slightly creepy grandfather clock. The ticking seems to be uneven.",
	"String.Antequary7": "A heavy mahogany desk covered in random knickknacks and appraisal tools. Best leave things alone",
	"String.BiscuitDrum1": "This drum kit hasnt been used in a while. It's covered in a very fine layer of flour.",
	"String.BiscuitDrum2": "Bags of flour, sugar, and large containers of lard have been stockpiled",
	"String.QuarryCave": "You can feel a slight breeze coming through the crack. You are not currently able to get through.", 
