	"String.Clinic2": "A bunch of flyers for local businesses and reminders about the benefits of oral health.", 
	"String.Clinic3": "A small scoresheet. Julius has 12 points, cavities have 7.", 
	
	// Quests
	"Quest.BeaLetter.Intro": "Hey @,^ I have an idea for that overgrown lot in town and im hopin' I can get your help. Come meet me there when you have a moment!^  - Bea",
	"Bundle.Phase1.Name": "Debris Cleanup",
	"Bundle.Phase1.Desc": "Before we can fix this place up, we need to clean it up a bit.",
	
	// Special Orders
	"Arden.SpecialOrder.ArtifactHunt.Name": "The Antiquarian’s Standard",
	"Arden.SpecialOrder.ArtifactHunt.Text": "Gunther is a hoarder of things. I am a curator of lives. He wants his things to take up every inch of available space on a shelf. I seek out the stories behind the relics of the past. Find the three specific relics that have been lost in the lower strata of the mines and bring them to me, not the museum. Show Timberline how well we understand the history of our valley as compared to the backward Pelican Town.",
	"Arden.SpecialOrder.ArtifactHunt.Success": "Sublime. Notice the patina? Gunther would have scrubbed that off in a matter of minutes. You have a keen eye for detail, @. History is a war, and we just gained the high ground. Take this, a duplicate from my collection.",
	"Arden.SpecialOrder.LostLexicon.Name": "The Lost Lexicon",
	"Arden.SpecialOrder.LostLexicon.Text": "The recovery of the lost books of the valley is a monumental task. However, preserving these texts requires more than just finding them. The ink is fading and the paper is brittle. Find for me 10 bars of Refined Quartz and 50 units of Solar Essence to aid in the preservation of these texts for another century.",
	"Arden.SpecialOrder.LostLexicon.Success": "The stabilizers are perfect. I have begun to transcribe the texts that existed before the unification of the valley. As a farmer, you are dedicated to our valley’s history, a trait unexpected in someone who farms for survival. I have cleared a shelf in the back for any findings you might have discovered on your own.",
	"Bea.SpecialOrder.BiscuitReserve.Name": "The Biscuit Reserve",
	"Bea.SpecialOrder.BiscuitReserve.Text": "I am low on baking supplies and will not serve wallpaper paste to my customers. I need a dedicated farmer to bring me 100 {Crop:TextPlural} to keep the Drum running.",
	"Bea.SpecialOrder.CommunityGumbo.Name": "Community Gumbo",
	"Bea.SpecialOrder.CommunityGumbo.Text": "The town’s morale is dipping so low, I’m making a massive pot of Community Gumbo. I need 24 fresh {Crop:TextPlural} to make the recipe come together. Bring ’em to the Drum, sugar.",
	"Bernard.SpecialOrder.GraveMatters.Name": "Grave Matters",
	"Bernard.SpecialOrder.GraveMatters.Text": "The frost heaves are tilting the headstones once again. The dead don't complain, but I do. Bring me 100 {Resource:TextPlural} to shore up the foundations of the graves. Don't loiter when you drop them off.",
	"Bernard.SpecialOrder.RestlessSpirits.Name": "Quiet the Bones",
	"Bernard.SpecialOrder.RestlessSpirits.Text": "The dead are supposed to be quiet. But the {Monster:LocalizedName} down in the mines give me a headache just thinking of them. Go smash 30 of them to give me some peace.",
	"Blaise.SpecialOrder.FeelTheBurn.Name": "Feel the Burn",
	"Blaise.SpecialOrder.FeelTheBurn.Text": "I'm chasing a new level of heat. Head to the deep mines and clear out 20 {Monster:LocalizedName} so I can study their core temperatures.",
	"Blaise.SpecialOrder.WildSpice.Name": "Wild Spice",
	"Blaise.SpecialOrder.WildSpice.Text": "I want to experiment with wild, earthy heat. Harvest and ship 50 {Forage:TextPlural} for my next batch. Don't worry, I know how to make them bite back.",
	"Cassidy.SpecialOrder.CaffeineCrisis.Name": "Caffeine Crisis!",
	"Cassidy.SpecialOrder.CaffeineCrisis.Text": "Emergency! The Drum is running low on coffee beans and my hands have stopped vibrating! Collect 100 Coffee Beans before I crash!",
	"Cassidy.SpecialOrder.SugarRush.Name": "Sugar Rush",
	"Cassidy.SpecialOrder.SugarRush.Text": "I've invented a new hyper-sweet espresso shot but need 50 {Crop:TextPlural} to make syrup. Harvest them ASAP!",
	"Clark.SpecialOrder.DataBackup.Name": "Data Backup",
	"Clark.SpecialOrder.DataBackup.Text": "According to my predictive models, Timberline Falls is about to have a severe power fluctuation. In order to save my servers, I need 5 Battery Packs.",
	"Clark.SpecialOrder.PalletWood.Name": "Logistical Supply",
	"Clark.SpecialOrder.PalletWood.Text": "The warehouse is low on pallets. Why not source locally? Get me 100 {Resource:TextPlural}!",
	"Dion.SpecialOrder.ShearElegance.Name": "Shear Elegance",
	"Dion.SpecialOrder.ShearElegance.Text": "Darling, we simply cannot thrive on these basic supplies from the valley! I require 10 {Resource:TextPlural} for the salon! Only the best for Timberline's split ends!",
	"Dion.SpecialOrder.MudMasks.Name": "Pore Perfection",
	"Dion.SpecialOrder.MudMasks.Text": "Darling, I know farming destroys the pores in the valley. But don’t worry, I’m making a fabulous organic facial for our favorite customers. Get 50 {Resource:TextPlural} for me; it sounds dreadful, but the results are stunning!",
	"Drexel.SpecialOrder.StructuralIntegrity.Name": "Structural Integrity",
	"Drexel.SpecialOrder.StructuralIntegrity.Text": "My tenants are complaining about the windows in my it's cheaper to fix them then have them sue me. I need 50 pieces of Hardwood to reinforce the windows. No cheap pine!",
	"Drexel.SpecialOrder.PestControl.Name": "Pest Control",
	"Drexel.SpecialOrder.PestControl.Text": "Those {Monster:LocalizedName} are a liability to my property values. Go into those caves and exterminate 20 of them before they migrate anywhere near my money....errr... tenants.",
	"Elara.SpecialOrder.TimetableTolerances.Name": "Timetable Tolerances",
	"Elara.SpecialOrder.TimetableTolerances.Text": "The switching tracks are degrading at a rate of 4%, which will destroy my entire timetable this week. Get 20 {Resource:TextPlural} for Jett to forge new tracks.",
	"Elara.SpecialOrder.BoilerFuel.Name": "Boiler Fuel",
	"Elara.SpecialOrder.BoilerFuel.Text": "Winter is approaching and the coal reserves are 15% below what they should be. Donate 100 Coal to the depot to keep the engines running!",
	"Gustavo.SpecialOrder.PerfectHeat.Name": "The Perfect Heat",
	"Gustavo.SpecialOrder.PerfectHeat.Text": "The local supply of aromatics is weak and uninspired. Harvest and ship 50 fresh {Crop:TextPlural}. If the quality is acceptable, I might mention your farm in my menu.",
	"Gustavo.SpecialOrder.TruffleHunt.Name": "Truffle Hunt",
	"Gustavo.SpecialOrder.TruffleHunt.Text": "My specials require premium ingredients. Bring me 5 Truffles. Bruised ones will not do.",
	"Jax.SpecialOrder.NeonNights.Name": "Neon Nights",
	"Jax.SpecialOrder.NeonNights.Text": "I need to prepare some materials for a guerrilla campaign to advertise this new line of products. Bring me 10 {Resource:TextPlural}.",
	"Jax.SpecialOrder.LateNightFuel.Name": "Late Night Fuel",
	"Jax.SpecialOrder.LateNightFuel.Text": "I’ve been up all night working on this corporate client’s menu. Bring me 10 cups of Coffee. Please.",
	"Jett.SpecialOrder.LubricationLogistics.Name": "Lubrication Logistics",
	"Jett.SpecialOrder.LubricationLogistics.Text": "The gears in the depot are grinding along at full capacity, but it sounds like a dying animal. Bring me 20 bottles of Oil.",
	"Jett.SpecialOrder.ScrapMetal.Name": "Scrap Metal",
	"Jett.SpecialOrder.ScrapMetal.Text": "I need to machine some gears that will replace the broken ones on the 4:10 freight. Bring me 50 {Resource:TextPlural}.",
	"Julius.SpecialOrder.PlaquePurge.Name": "The Plaque Purge",
	"Julius.SpecialOrder.PlaquePurge.Text": "The {Monster:LocalizedName} in the caves are nothing but giant, sentient blobs of bacterial plaque! Eradicate 50 of them in the name of hygiene!",
	"Julius.SpecialOrder.NaturesFloss.Name": "Nature's Floss",
	"Julius.SpecialOrder.NaturesFloss.Text": "Dietary fiber acts as nature's toothbrush. I am forcing the town to eat more greens. Bring 100 {Resource:TextPlural} to the clinic for distribution.",
	"Mabel.SpecialOrder.BerryGoodNeighbors.Name": "Berry Good Neighbors",
	"Mabel.SpecialOrder.BerryGoodNeighbors.Text": "I've decided it's high time I baked a batch of fresh fruit pies for the whole town. Could a strapping young farmer harvest and ship 50 {Crop:TextPlural} for me?",
	"Mabel.SpecialOrder.WinterKnitting.Name": "Winter Knitting",
	"Mabel.SpecialOrder.WinterKnitting.Text": "The wind off the falls gets so cold, and I want to knit scarves for some of the younger folks. Could you bring me 10 pieces of Wool, dear?",
	"Mara.SpecialOrder.RiverCleanup.Name": "River Cleanup",
	"Mara.SpecialOrder.RiverCleanup.Text": "The river is choking on the things people throw away. Please, take your rod and pull 20 pieces of Trash from the waters.",
	"Mara.SpecialOrder.AquaticStudy.Name": "Aquatic Study",
	"Mara.SpecialOrder.AquaticStudy.Text": "The {Fish:TextPlural} are acting strangely in the current. Catch 10 of them so I can observe them, and then we will release them back to the water.",
	"Orson.SpecialOrder.OldSchoolCraft.Name": "Old School Craft",
	"Orson.SpecialOrder.OldSchoolCraft.Text": "These modern, plastic tools break if you look at them wrong. Bring me 100 {Resource:TextPlural}, and I'll show the kids how to carve a real handle.",
	"Orson.SpecialOrder.HardwareFix.Name": "Hardware Fix",
	"Orson.SpecialOrder.HardwareFix.Text": "I'm fixing up an old threshing machine, but the modern wire is trash. Bring me 20 {Resource:TextPlural} of real, local metal.",
	"Remy.SpecialOrder.AcousticResonance.Name": "Acoustic Resonance",
	"Remy.SpecialOrder.AcousticResonance.Text": "I'm trying to craft a new instrument, but it needs to resonate with the exact color of the forest. Gather and bring me 100 {Resource:TextPlural} to dampen the sound.",
	"Remy.SpecialOrder.CampfireChords.Name": "Campfire Chords",
	"Remy.SpecialOrder.CampfireChords.Text": "I'm trying to write an acoustic song that sounds like a crackling hearth. Bring me 100 Wood so I can build a campfire and listen to the rhythm.",
	"Riley.SpecialOrder.WritersBlock.Name": "Writer's Block",
	"Riley.SpecialOrder.WritersBlock.Text": "I've hit a creative wall, and typical ink simply lacks the visceral tragedy I need for my final chapter. Bring me 5 vials of Squid Ink.",
	"Riley.SpecialOrder.MidnightOil.Name": "Midnight Oil",
	"Riley.SpecialOrder.MidnightOil.Text": "I'm writing late into the night, and the electric lights give my prose a sterile feel. Bring me 10 bottles of Oil for my lamps so I can write in peace.",
	"Roxy.SpecialOrder.DarkAesthetic.Name": "Dark Aesthetic",
	"Roxy.SpecialOrder.DarkAesthetic.Text": "My band is shooting a promo video and we need it to look terrifying. Head into the caves and slay 30 {Monster:LocalizedName} for us. It's for the aesthetic.",
	"Roxy.SpecialOrder.PropMeat.Name": "Prop Meat",
	"Roxy.SpecialOrder.PropMeat.Text": "We need gross props for our next music video. Bring me 50 pieces of Bug Meat. It's perfectly disgusting.",
	"Silas.SpecialOrder.WinterPrep.Name": "Winter Prep",
	"Silas.SpecialOrder.WinterPrep.Text": "The cold doesn't care if you're ready or not. I'm stocking my root cellar. Bring me 20 {Forage:TextPlural}. They last through the freeze.",
	"Silas.SpecialOrder.ThinTheHerd.Name": "Thin The Herd",
	"Silas.SpecialOrder.ThinTheHerd.Text": "The {Monster:LocalizedName} in the mines will eventually become a problem for the surface. Thin the herd. Kill 30 of them before they migrate.",
	"Vance.SpecialOrder.PerimeterDefense.Name": "Perimeter Defense",
	"Vance.SpecialOrder.PerimeterDefense.Text": "The {Monster:LocalizedName} are probing our defenses. I need someone with clearance to head down there. Eliminate 15 of them. Do not hesitate.",
	"Vance.SpecialOrder.TargetPractice.Name": "Target Practice",
	"Vance.SpecialOrder.TargetPractice.Text": "Your aerial tracking is sloppy. Head to the mines and practice your swing on 30 {Monster:LocalizedName}. Do not miss.",
}